abstract: >
  Enterprises deploying autonomous multi-agent AI systems face a fundamental
  governance gap: traditional IT GRC frameworks operate at human speed while
  agentic AI systems operate at machine speed. This paper introduces
  meta-governance as a novel IS security construct and presents MOM-GS-MAS,
  a production-ready meta-governance platform deploying 16 specialized
  governance agents across four SAGS pillars, achieving sub-100ms policy
  enforcement and 99.1% compliance at 1,000-agent fleet scale.
